<div class="tsp-pro"><div class="act-light">
<section class="sec proof" style="background:var(--card);border-top:1px solid var(--hair);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--act)">全球佈局</p>
      <h2 style="margin-top:10px">台灣起家，進軍日本。</h2>
      <p class="fund__total"><span>系列產品三場募資累計總金額</span><b>約 NT$ 1,323 萬</b></p>
      <p class="lede" style="margin:14px auto 0;max-width:32em">穩如鈦山第一代在台灣嘖嘖募資突破千萬；Pro 這一代，台灣與日本兩地募資都達標成功——安全這件事，跨語言都聽得懂。</p>
      <div class="fund__car" id="fundCar">
        <img class="on" src="{{ 'tsp-daily-ts-fund-w-tw1.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="嘖嘖募資頁：第一代 NT$10,351,535、4,184 人贊助、103,515% 達成">
        <img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-ts-fund-w-pro.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="嘖嘖募資頁：Pro NT$2,427,988、915 人贊助、2,427% 達成">
        <img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-ts-fund-w-jp.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Makuake 募資頁：¥2,230,800、226 人支持、2,230% 達成">
      </div>
      <div class="fund__tabswrap">
        <div class="fund__tabs" id="fundTabs" role="tablist" aria-label="募資場次">
          <i class="fund__pill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <button type="button" class="on" role="tab" aria-selected="true">台灣第一檔</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">台灣第二檔</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">日本第一檔</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center">
        <h2>他們也在用。</h2>
        <p class="lede">KOL 與真實用戶的開箱、實測與評價。</p>
      </div>
            <div class="masonry" aria-label="方案 A：瀑布式背書牆（示意）">
        <div class="kmedia m-v" style="background:linear-gradient(160deg,#3a3f4b,#15171c)">
          <span class="ktag">Reels・直式影片</span>
          <div class="kplay"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="kinfo"><b>@daily.gadget</b><span>「摔下去撿回來繼續充」開箱 45 秒</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kmedia m-h" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#4b3a3a,#181214)">
          <span class="ktag">YouTube・橫式影片</span>
          <div class="kplay"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="kinfo"><b>阿哲・3C 開箱</b><span>警鈴實測＋拆解 12:36</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kol">
          <div class="kh">
            <span class="ava" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e8e93,#5a5a5f)">M</span>
            <span class="who"><b>Mia 通勤日常</b><span>Threads・真實買家</span></span>
          </div>
          <span class="stars" aria-label="5 顆星">★★★★★</span>
          <q>磁吸貼著化妝，出門已經六成。螢幕會顯示溫度這點很安心。</q>
        </div>
        <div class="kmedia m-s" style="background:linear-gradient(165deg,#3d4b3a,#131711)">
          <span class="ktag">Instagram・照片</span>
          <div class="kinfo"><b>@cafe.worker</b><span>咖啡廳邊充邊追劇的日常</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kmedia m-h" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#3a424b,#121518)">
          <span class="ktag">UGC・橫式影片</span>
          <div class="kplay"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="kinfo"><b>買家投稿</b><span>汽車輾壓後照樣能充</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kolwall" hidden aria-label="口碑背書牆（示意內容，上線後由 GrantOS 自動供稿）">
        <div class="kol">
          <div class="kh">
            <span class="ava" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff7854,#d64541)">哲</span>
            <span class="who"><b>阿哲・3C 開箱</b><span>YouTube・訂閱 12 萬</span></span>
          </div>
          <span class="stars" aria-label="5 顆星">★★★★★</span>
          <q>警鈴直接按給你聽——我開箱過上百顆行動電源，第一次看到有人敢把「安全」做成能自己測試的功能。</q>
          <span class="kfoot">開箱影片・2026/08</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kol">
          <div class="kh">
            <span class="ava" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5b8def,#3f5fc4)">D</span>
            <span class="who"><b>@daily.gadget</b><span>Instagram・追蹤 3.8 萬</span></span>
          </div>
          <span class="stars" aria-label="5 顆星">★★★★★</span>
          <q>騎車掉出口袋，撿回來殼花了、電照充。原本只是想要顆快充，結果買到一顆摔不壞的。</q>
          <span class="kfoot">限時動態精選・2026/07</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kol">
          <div class="kh">
            <span class="ava" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e8e93,#5a5a5f)">M</span>
            <span class="who"><b>Mia 通勤日常</b><span>Threads・真實買家</span></span>
          </div>
          <span class="stars" aria-label="5 顆星">★★★★★</span>
          <q>出門前發現手機剩 20%，磁吸貼著化妝，出門已經六成。螢幕會顯示溫度這點很安心。</q>
          <span class="kfoot">購買後評價・2026/08</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:16px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2)">以上為版位示意內容，非真實評價——上線後由 GrantOS 背書牆自動帶入真實的 KOL 開箱與買家評價。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div></div>
